{"seq":1,"slug":"lot-disposition-decision-model","title":"批次处置决策模型：放行、返工、让步接收与拒收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/lot-disposition-supplier/lot-disposition-decision-model","wordCount":2875,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"批次处置决策模型-放行-返工-让步接收与拒收\">批次处置决策模型：放行、返工、让步接收与拒收</h1><p>AQL 报告给出 <code>Re</code>（拒收）结论的那一刻，真正的分歧才开始：这批货是整批退回工厂、拉出来一件件挑、还是填一张让步单直接放行装柜？很多团队把&quot;拒收&quot;直接等同于&quot;退货&quot;，结果在一批只含 3 件可返修划痕的货上付了整柜海运的退运费用；也有团队把&quot;接收&quot;直接等同于&quot;放行&quot;，让一件关键安全缺陷的货蒙混进柜，直到海外仓收货时被平台下架。**AQL 判定回答的是&quot;这批的统计信号够不够接收&quot;，处置决策回答的是&quot;这批货接下来往哪去&quot;——两者前后相接，但判据完全不同。**本文把第二阶段拆开：先厘清处置选项与判定结论的映射，再给出以期望损失为核心的决策模型，然后界定让步接收的硬边界，最后落到返工验证与供应商责任闭环。缺陷如何分档决定了哪些处置路径被打开，见 <a href=\"../aql-sampling-plan/defect-class-critical-major-minor\">缺陷分级判定</a>；<code>Ac/Re</code> 数字本身怎么算出来见 <a href=\"../aql-sampling-plan/sampling-plan-ac-re-calculation\">抽样方案机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-判定-处置-放行是三件事\">核心概念：判定、处置、放行是三件事</h2><p>先把三个常被混用的词钉死，后面的成本模型才有落脚点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>谁给出</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判定（verdict）</td>\n<td>抽样后该批&quot;接收 / 拒收&quot;的统计结论</td>\n<td>检验机构按 AQL 表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac/Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置（disposition）</td>\n<td>对不合格批次采取的处理动作</td>\n<td>买方质量 + 供应商</td>\n<td>期望损失、可修复性、交期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放行（release）</td>\n<td>允许该批进入下一环节（装柜、发运）</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>处置结论为可发运</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ISO 9001:2015 第 8.7 条「不合格输出的控制」把处置动作写成了一份权威清单：对不合格输出应采取<strong>纠正、隔离/暂扣、退货或暂停服务、告知客户、取得让步授权</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/62085.html\">ISO 9001:2015 §8.7</a>）。这份清单里没有一条叫&quot;放行&quot;——放行是处置完成后另行授予的动作。汽车行业的 IATF 16949 收紧了一层：任何&quot;照用（use as is）&quot;必须取得<strong>客户的书面让步</strong>，且须记录让步的有效期与数量（<a href=\"https://www.iatfglobaloversight.org/\">IATF 16949:2016 §8.7</a>）。把握住&quot;判定、处置、放行&quot;三分，就不会再有&quot;报告写着接收所以我就装了&quot;的滑落。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置选项与判定结论的映射\">处置选项与判定结论的映射</h2><p>判定只有两个取值，处置却至少有六条路径。关系不是一一对应，而是<strong>接收必然导向放行（或暂缓放行），拒收则打开一个分支</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  V[PSI 抽样判定 d vs Ac/Re] --&gt; ACC{判定结论}&#10;  ACC --&gt;|d 小于等于 Ac 接收| REL[放行 release]&#10;  ACC --&gt;|d 大于等于 Re 拒收| BR{打开处置分支}&#10;  BR --&gt; RW[返工 rework&lt;br/&gt;修复后重新判定]&#10;  BR --&gt; SORT[挑选/全检 sort&lt;br/&gt;剔除不合格件后重新判定]&#10;  BR --&gt; CON[让步接收 concession&lt;br/&gt;条件放行]&#10;  BR --&gt; RJ[拒收退货 reject/return]&#10;  BR --&gt; SC[报废 scrap]&#10;  RW --&gt; REJ{重新判定}&#10;  SORT --&gt; REJ2{重新判定}&#10;  CON --&gt; APV{合规与安全硬门}&#10;  APV --&gt;|通过且有授权| REL2[条件放行&lt;br/&gt;附让步记录]&#10;  APV --&gt;|不通过| RJ&#10;  REJ --&gt;|通过| REL3[放行]&#10;  REJ2 --&gt;|通过| REL3&#10;  REJ --&gt;|仍不通过| RJ\">graph TD\n  V[PSI 抽样判定 d vs Ac/Re] --&gt; ACC{判定结论}\n  ACC --&gt;|d 小于等于 Ac 接收| REL[放行 release]\n  ACC --&gt;|d 大于等于 Re 拒收| BR{打开处置分支}\n  BR --&gt; RW[返工 rework&lt;br/&gt;修复后重新判定]\n  BR --&gt; SORT[挑选/全检 sort&lt;br/&gt;剔除不合格件后重新判定]\n  BR --&gt; CON[让步接收 concession&lt;br/&gt;条件放行]\n  BR --&gt; RJ[拒收退货 reject/return]\n  BR --&gt; SC[报废 scrap]\n  RW --&gt; REJ{重新判定}\n  SORT --&gt; REJ2{重新判定}\n  CON --&gt; APV{合规与安全硬门}\n  APV --&gt;|通过且有授权| REL2[条件放行&lt;br/&gt;附让步记录]\n  APV --&gt;|不通过| RJ\n  REJ --&gt;|通过| REL3[放行]\n  REJ2 --&gt;|通过| REL3\n  REJ --&gt;|仍不通过| RJ</pre><p>这张图里最关键的一条：<strong>返工和挑选都不是终点，终点是&quot;重新判定&quot;</strong>。把一批货返修完就发走、不做复检，等于把风险从 PSI 阶段平移到了无人复核的下游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策模型-用期望损失而非情绪选路径\">决策模型：用期望损失而非情绪选路径</h2><p>处置选择的本质是一次<strong>成本权衡</strong>：把带残次率的批次放出去，损失发生在下游（客诉、退货、平台罚款、品牌折损）；拦下来返工，成本发生在当下（人工、停工、交期）。用一个单参数模型就能把大多数争议量化。</p>\n<p>设批次量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、当前残余不合格率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、单件逃逸成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含海外退货物流、赔付、平台扣分折算）、单件返工成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。&quot;直接放行&quot;与&quot;先返工再放行&quot;的期望成本分别为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>release</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>rw</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C_{\\text{release}}] = p N C_e, \\qquad E[C_{\\text{rework}}] = N C_r + p(1-d_{\\text{rw}}) N C_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">release</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">pN</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>rw</mtext></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{rw}} \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是返工工序的<strong>检出并修复率</strong>——它不是 1，因为返工本身也可能漏检。令两式相等，得<strong>返工盈亏平衡点</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>rw</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^{*} = \\frac{C_r}{C_e \\cdot d_{\\text{rw}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>含义很直接：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;_&#x27; at position 8: p &gt; p^{_̲}\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">p &gt; p^{_}</span></span> 时返工划算，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;_&#x27; at position 8: p &lt; p^{_̲}\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">p &lt; p^{_}</span></span> 时直放更省。举例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 元/件、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_e = 40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 元/件、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>rw</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{rw}} = 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>5.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^{*} \\approx 5.6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.6%</span></span></span></span></span>——一批不合格率 8% 的货值得返工，一批 2% 的货返工反而亏。这解释了为什么<strong>小面积可返修缺陷常常选择让步而非整批返工</strong>：拒收结论是按 <code>Re</code> 阈值触发的，但触发阈值的那点缺陷量，其期望损失可能远低于返工成本。</p>\n<p>挑选（100% 全检）是返工的特例：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 换成逐件人工成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，检出率换成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>sort</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{sort}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sort</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（对目视化的尺寸、外观缺陷通常 0.95–0.99，对功能性缺陷显著更低）。<strong>挑选会破坏批的完整性</strong>——全检后的产品不再是随机样本批，其残余不合格率只能由检出率估计而不能由抽样表反推，因此全检后必须重新定义批量与判定方案，不能沿用原报告结论。四种主流处置路径的成本与风险对比如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置路径</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n<th>交期影响</th>\n<th>残余风险</th>\n<th>典型批准层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>放行（接收批）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\le Ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>逃逸损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p N C_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">pN</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>抽样允许的消费者风险</td>\n<td>检验员按表判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>让步接收</td>\n<td>拒收但缺陷可接受、不可修复</td>\n<td>折价 + 客诉风险</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>高，且不可逆</td>\n<td>质量+工程+客户书面授权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返工</td>\n<td>缺陷可修复、量可控</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数天至数周</td>\n<td>返工漏检残余</td>\n<td>买方质量批准返工方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>挑选后放行</td>\n<td>缺陷可检出、件数可控</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数天</td>\n<td>全检漏检残余</td>\n<td>买方质量批准全检标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒收退货</td>\n<td>缺陷严重/不可修复/法规类</td>\n<td>退运费 + 重产 + 交期</td>\n<td>数周，可能断货</td>\n<td>低（货离开）</td>\n<td>采购+质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报废</td>\n<td>无修复价值、退货不经济</td>\n<td>全部货值</td>\n<td>需重产</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>采购+财务+质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"让步接收的硬边界-什么可以让-什么绝不能让\">让步接收的硬边界：什么可以让，什么绝不能让</h2><p>让步接收（concession / deviation waiver）是六条路径里风险最高、也最容易被滥用的一个：不返工、不退货，签个字就发走，成本看起来总是最低。<strong>让步的本质是&quot;已知偏离规格、经授权接受&quot;，而不是&quot;假装缺陷不存在&quot;</strong>，因此它的可行域由三道硬门界定，缺任何一道都不能走：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>安全门。</strong> 涉及人身安全、电气安全、儿童产品小部件、阻燃、承重结构的缺陷，无论量多小都不能让步。欧盟《通用产品安全法规》（GPSR，Regulation (EU) 2023/988，2024-12-13 全面适用）要求进入欧盟市场的消费品必须安全，并对经营者规定追溯与事故报告义务（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/988/oj\">EU GPSR</a>）；美国消费品受 CPSIA 与 CPSC 强制标准约束。让步单在两个法域下都不能覆盖法定安全要求。</li>\n<li><strong>法规/认证门。</strong> 涉及强制认证（CE、UKCA、FCC、CCC）或标签合规的偏离不能让步——标签、说明书、认证标识错了，整改方式是返工而非签字放行。医疗器械（ISO 13485:2016 §8.3）与汽车（IATF 16949 §8.7）都把&quot;让步&quot;与&quot;客户书面授权&quot;绑定，不允许内部单方决定（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/59752.html\">ISO 13485:2016</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>平台/客户门。</strong> 大型平台对食品接触材料、电池、化妆品等类别设有不可让步的强制项；客户合同若写明 AQL 为硬门，让步须由客户书面确认并留档。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>跨过三道门之后，让步仍需<strong>量化残留风险并留痕</strong>：让步单至少要记录批次号、偏离的规格条款、缺陷类别与件数、有效期（本次、本批还是长期）、批准人、以及随货通知。<strong>&quot;有效期仅限本批&quot;是默认值</strong>——把一次让步写成长期豁免等于悄悄改了规格，会在下一次审核或客诉时暴露。最好把这条边界和缺陷分级挂钩：关键（Critical）缺陷默认零容忍、不可让步，主要（Major）缺陷可修复时优先返工，只有次要（Minor）才进入让步评审，分类规则见 <a href=\"../aql-sampling-plan/defect-class-critical-major-minor\">缺陷分级判定</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"返工与挑选的验证闭环\">返工与挑选的验证闭环</h2><p>处置决策一旦落到&quot;返工&quot;或&quot;挑选&quot;，风险并没有消失，而是转移到了<strong>返工质量与复检有效性</strong>上。三条实操纪律：</p>\n<p><strong>一、返工方案先批准、后执行。</strong> 返工前要定义清楚：修什么、用什么工艺、谁执行、判定标准（返工后按哪个 Ac/Re 复检）。供应商自行&quot;修好了&quot;而不经买方认可，复检结论不可信。</p>\n<p><strong>二、复检必须重新抽样、重新判定。</strong> 返工后的批是一个<strong>新的生产批</strong>，批量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、缺陷分布都可能已变，必须按新批重新走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\to n \\to Ac/Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 的计算链。直接引用原报告的 <code>Ac</code> 或凭&quot;目视都好了&quot;放行，是本阶段最常见的合规漏洞。</p>\n<p><strong>三、让步与隔离必须被证据链锚定。</strong> 被暂扣（hold）的批次在物理上必须与控制流分开——加贴 hold 标签、独立区域存放、系统里改状态，防止&quot;判定未完结的货&quot;被误装。装柜时若一批货处于 hold 或让步待批状态，监装员需核验处置单据并随封条记录一并留证，见 <a href=\"../loading-supervision/loading-supervision-seal-verification\">监装执行与封条核验机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商侧的闭环-从单批处置到系统性纠正\">供应商侧的闭环：从单批处置到系统性纠正</h2><p>单批处置解决的是&quot;这一批货怎么办&quot;，但若同类缺陷在下一批重复出现，说明根因未除。成熟买家用两层工具把单批决策升级为供应商管理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>逐批层：让步/拒收记录 + 索赔（chargeback）。</strong> 每次让步或拒收转化为供应商绩效数据：让步频次、拒收率、返工周期；返工产生的额外人工、检验与物流成本按合同向供应商索赔，形成经济压力。</li>\n<li><strong>系统层：SCAR / CAPA / 8D。</strong> 当同一供应商的让步或拒收在统计上重复（如连续三批出现同类主要缺陷），触发<strong>供应商纠正措施请求</strong>（SCAR, Supplier Corrective Action Request）或 <strong>8D 报告</strong>，要求供应商做根因分析（鱼骨图、5 Why）并给出永久纠正措施（CAPA），买方验证有效性后关单（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/62085.html\">ISO 9001:2015 §10.2</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两层是<strong>trigger 与 response</strong> 的关系：单批处置量出问题的规模与频率，SCAR/CAPA 消除根因。只做前者，等于每次都买单、从不治病；只做后者，单批货仍在无明确处置结论的状态下流转。把处置产出结构化归档（批次号、缺陷分类、处置路径、期望成本估算、批准人），既满足 ISO 9001 §8.7 的记录要求，也让供应商分级从&quot;印象分&quot;变成可审计的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>批次处置决策模型的核心是一个三分结构：AQL 判定只回答统计信号，处置决策用期望损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 在放行、返工、挑选、让步、拒收、报废之间选路径，放行则是处置完成后的独立授权动作。返工盈亏平衡点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>rw</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^{*} = C_r / (C_e d_{\\text{rw}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把&quot;该不该返工&quot;从争论变成算术；让步接收的可行域被安全、法规、客户三道硬门锁定，且默认仅限本批；返工与挑选的落脚点是<strong>重新判定</strong>而非直接发运。把每批处置记录成数据、把重复缺陷升级为 SCAR/CAPA，才能让单批决策累积成供应商质量能力的提升。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批次处置决策模型：放行、返工、让步接收与拒收","id":"批次处置决策模型-放行-返工-让步接收与拒收"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：判定、处置、放行是三件事","id":"核心概念-判定-处置-放行是三件事"},{"level":2,"text":"处置选项与判定结论的映射","id":"处置选项与判定结论的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"决策模型：用期望损失而非情绪选路径","id":"决策模型-用期望损失而非情绪选路径"},{"level":2,"text":"让步接收的硬边界：什么可以让，什么绝不能让","id":"让步接收的硬边界-什么可以让-什么绝不能让"},{"level":2,"text":"返工与挑选的验证闭环","id":"返工与挑选的验证闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商侧的闭环：从单批处置到系统性纠正","id":"供应商侧的闭环-从单批处置到系统性纠正"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"封柜异常处置：货损、短装与封条篡改的判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/loading-supervision/container-damage-shortage-exception"},"next":{"title":"供应商纠正措施 CAPA 与 8D 闭环机制：从 NCR 到有效性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/lot-disposition-supplier/supplier-capa-8d-closure"}}